    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:02 AM",
      "text": "What’s the Kumar Rocker equivalent of Tank for Tork"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:02 AM",
      "text": "#TankforKumarRocker"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:07 AM",
      "text": "I guess? Nothing really good that begins with K or R"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:07 AM",
      "text": "I know"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:09 AM",
      "text": "Any way to incorporate an “@anthonyfenech first” into that"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:09 AM",
      "text": "Either in same tweet or in a reply"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:09 AM",
      "text": "As if I’m asking for credit for hash tagging that"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:18 AM",
      "text": "Just respond to it with that"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:32 AM",
      "text": "Someone just shit all over me"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:33 AM",
      "text": "#HitRockerBottom"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:35 AM",
      "text": "God dammit that’s so good"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:35 AM",
      "text": "Good thing I didn’t use it first"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:36 AM",
      "text": "#CanceltheseasonforKumarRocker"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:36 AM",
      "text": "Just a poor creative effort all around"
    }
  ]
